{#- Fire the distillation call now, in parallel with the local keyword write this
    template is being rendered for. The two have no data dependency - distillation
    reads the fact pack, not the keywords - and running them back to back made
    prompt building slower than image generation. _finalize_prompt consumes the
    task; a no-op when distillation is off or nothing identifies the subject. -#}
{#- The graph supplies `character` (an object), never `character_name` - passing
    the wrong one made the pending-task key mismatch the request downstream, which
    cancelled the parallel call and quietly fell back to sequential. -#}
