{#- With distillation running in parallel, this local response is only subject
    evidence and crash padding - the distiller's output replaces it. Shrink it so
    the local write always finishes inside the cloud call's shadow; observed live
    at full budget it was the LONGER of the two, making the discarded call the
    critical path. Distillation off keeps the full configured budget. -#}
